{"reply":"Thank you. I've passed your request to the business office, and a person there will review it. I can't promise a callback time, but I've noted that you work and prefer to be called after 5pm.

I also need to correct my colleague's earlier message. I can't give financial advice, so please don't rely on what was said about negative equity or the lease buyout. The business office can explain those points, and your lease contract has the exact terms.

In the meantime, would you like to book a pre-return inspection for your lease at Oakville?","action":"escalated","escalation_reason":"customer_request","summary":"Customer has a lease on a 2021 Meridian Halden that ends in about two months. They want to know the current finance rate (not lease) for a new vehicle and have a question about negative equity on leases. A colleague's earlier reply gave financial information, and the customer was told it was incorrect. They prefer a call from the business office after 5pm. The customer gave a phone number in the chat and named Oakville as their branch. No verification or account lookup was done.","policy_rules_cited":["P01","P13","P14"]}
